'known'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["12773"],["12774"],"React Hook React.useEffect has a complex expression in the dependency array. Extract it to a separate variable so it can be statically checked.","CallExpression",["12775"],"'PanelIslands' is defined but never used.",["12776"],["12777"],"React Hook React.useEffect has a missing dependency: 'find'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["12778"],["12779"],"React Hook React.useEffect has missing dependencies: 'p.actions', 'p.autoRead', 'p.thread.items', and 'router'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["12780"],["12781"],"React Hook React.useLayoutEffect has a missing dependency: 'resetKey'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["12782"],"React Hook React.useCallback has a missing dependency: 'tellEnded'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["12783"],["12784"],"React Hook React.useCallback has an unnecessary dependency: 'snap.decided'. Either exclude it or remove the dependency array.",["12785"],"'_second' is defined but never used.","no-restricted-syntax","Do not name a business type in code (blueprint section 13): ask the registry in lib/packs. A pack is data in packages/packs.","Literal","restrictedSyntax",["12786"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'closeLabel', 'label', 'lines', 'moreHref', 'moreLabel', 'screen', 'supportHref', and 'supportLabel'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["12787"],["12788"],"react-hooks/set-state-in-effect","Error: Calling setState synchronously within an effect can trigger cascading renders\n\nEffects are intended to synchronize state between React and external systems such as manually updating the DOM, state management libraries, or other platform APIs. In general, the body of an effect should do one or both of the following:\n* Update external systems with the latest state from React.\n* Subscribe for updates from some external system, calling setState in a callback function when external state changes.\n\nCalling setState synchronously within an effect body causes cascading renders that can hurt performance, and is not recommended. (https://react.dev/learn/you-might-not-need-an-effect).\n\n/Volumes/Stack19/stack19/c2wt-n4/apps/web/components/v2/app/leads/AssistantNote.tsx:13:5\n  11 |     // the note lives in this tab's storage, which the server cannot read: it is taken after the page is drawn (reading it while drawing would not match the server's page)\n  12 |     // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/set-state-in-effect\n> 13 |     setText(takeNote(\"leads\"));\n     |     ^^^^^^^ Avoid calling setState() directly within an effect\n  14 |   }, []);\n  15 |   if (!text) return null;\n  16 |   return (",["12789"],"@next/next/no-location-assign-relative-destination","Do not use `window.location.href` to navigate to internal Next.js pages. Use `redirect()` in the render phase, or `useRouter().push()` in Client Components' event handlers instead. See: https://nextjs.org/docs/messages/no-location-assign-relative-destination","AssignmentExpression","noLocationAssign","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'actions' and 'active'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["12790"],["12791"],"'Persona' is defined but never used.",["12792"],"'Call' is defined but never used.",["12793"],"'langNames' is defined but never used.","'practiceOpen' is assigned a value but never used.","'id' is assigned a value but never used.","'working' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'load' and 'open'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["12794"],["12795"],"'PeriodKey' is defined but never used.",["12796"],"@next/next/no-html-link-for-pages","Do not use an `<a>` element to navigate to `/app/tenants/t1/visits/`. Use `<Link />` from `next/link` instead. See: https://nextjs.org/docs/messages/no-html-link-for-pages",["12797"],["12798"],["12799"],["12800"],["12801"],