local preview of the photo just picked (a blob: address, checked here), not a site image","Update the dependencies array to be: [base, card.id, card.note, card.replayed, card.spec, pathname, router]",{"range":"12956","text":"12957"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [sendIt, takeFiles, talkAttach]",{"range":"12958","text":"12959"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [actions, thread.items]",{"range":"12960","text":"12961"},"Cartesia's own SVG, committed to /public/brand, shown as it is (their rule: no resizing tricks)","the white file for dark backgrounds","Update the dependencies array to be: [calm, text, voice.playing]",{"range":"12962","text":"12963"},"the words are fixed for the page","Update the dependencies array to be: [initial]",{"range":"12964","text":"12965"},"ApiRequestError",[429,446],[1101,1104],"unknown",[1101,1104],"never","PackFrame",[405,421],[1368,1384],"[fraction, playing, total]","DictInput",[24,34],[1425,1459],"[known]","PanelIslands",[1711,1724],[5112,5125],"[query, lead, find]",[5926,5936],"[p.actions, p.autoRead, p.leadId, p.thread.items, router]",[1400,1411],"[resetKey, signature]",[8892,8899],"[reset, tellEnded]",[12239,12246],[16014,16060],"[snap?.plan, planBusy, waiting]",[1734,1739],"[closeLabel, key, label, lines, moreHref, moreLabel, screen, supportHref, supportLabel]",[2797,2802],"[actions, active, key]","Persona",[259,273],"Call",[273,300],[2319,2321],"[load, open]","PeriodKey",[441,457],[3967,3976],"[base, card.id, card.note, card.replayed, card.spec, pathname, router]",[7521,7533],"[sendIt, takeFiles, talkAttach]",[2729,2731],"[actions, thread.items]",[6768,6789],"[calm, text, voice.playing]",[2664,2700],"[initial]"]